186
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:55,930
 Oh, my friend, it was an error of youth.

187
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:58,510
 Who hasn't made them? That's all for God now.

188
00:19:58,530 --> 00:20:02,350
 All the same, do you recall Coney Barron's attack on Lamarck's theories?

189
